{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this detective deduction game, uncover information by investigating the locals then use that information to deduce good from evil. Discover who is part of the evil syndicate as you travel from region to region, all while maintaining your reputation and evading the syndicates attempts to deceive you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put an end to the syndicate. Or get duped trying, like the rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/9c84ddcebf4700a9f87b1a80de5f27f0.avif?t=1773414368\" alt=\"DON&#039;T GET DUPED\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.poster.avif?t=1773414368\" width=1170 height=762 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.webm?t=1773414368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.mp4?t=1773414368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you solve each case you\u2019ll be presented with boards containing a selection of suspects from\u00a0<strong>over 200 roles</strong>\u00a0each with unique mechanics and information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master them all, learn their tells, and utilise all the note taking tools at your disposal to figure out who is lying, and who is evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, the syndicates underlings are tricky, if you arrest good folk, it\u2019ll ruin your reputation and eventually get you fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f325054790ef077d6a9b47bafccb6ed7.avif?t=1773414368\" alt=\"EVIL SPREADS UNCHECKED\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.poster.avif?t=1773414368\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.webm?t=1773414368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.mp4?t=1773414368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful syndicate is operating from the shadows and must be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to find and take down their leader, but to do this you\u2019ll first need to discover their identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues about the mysterious figure by taking down the syndicate\u2019s four branch leaders, each situated in a different region of the city, and extract what little information you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They won\u2019t let you catch them easily; you\u2019ll need to best each regions unique roles and mechanics if you hope to get your answers. \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f07e365de811cd5423256d96ccd58377.avif?t=1773414368\" alt=\"END IT ONCE AND FOR ALL\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all comes to an end once you\u2019ve acquired the clues you need to find the syndicate leader. Use the information you\u2019ve collected to pick the mastermind out of the lineup and end it for good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/05eded008627ea952670f603b0b34a19.avif?t=1773414368\" alt=\"ALTERNATIVE MODES\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is more than just one way to play and experiment within Dupery. Try daily challenges, custom suspect role packs, make custom cases, explore the games workshop support, modding, endless mode, quirk challenges and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan the perfect crime in our Two Player mode<strong>\u00a0</strong>or figure out who is working for the syndicate in our Three player mode.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845070?t=1773414368","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845070?t=1773414368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/f2fb63e15dbe394b03d5c6919eb52add0a7e3051/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773414368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/f2fb63e15dbe394b03d5c6919eb52add0a7e3051/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773414368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4111760,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this detective deduction game, uncover information by investigating the locals then use that information to deduce good from evil. Discover who is part of the evil syndicate as you travel from region to region, all while maintaining your reputation and evading the syndicates attempts to deceive you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put an end to the syndicate. Or get duped trying, like the rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/9c84ddcebf4700a9f87b1a80de5f27f0.avif?t=1773414368\" alt=\"DON&#039;T GET DUPED\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.poster.avif?t=1773414368\" width=1170 height=762 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.webm?t=1773414368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/eb923744cd49aee99e0bdb2a89582597.mp4?t=1773414368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you solve each case you\u2019ll be presented with boards containing a selection of suspects from\u00a0<strong>over 200 roles</strong>\u00a0each with unique mechanics and information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master them all, learn their tells, and utilise all the note taking tools at your disposal to figure out who is lying, and who is evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, the syndicates underlings are tricky, if you arrest good folk, it\u2019ll ruin your reputation and eventually get you fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f325054790ef077d6a9b47bafccb6ed7.avif?t=1773414368\" alt=\"EVIL SPREADS UNCHECKED\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.poster.avif?t=1773414368\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.webm?t=1773414368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/854bde812b86981a2d6a38fe1b75bf0e.mp4?t=1773414368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful syndicate is operating from the shadows and must be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to find and take down their leader, but to do this you\u2019ll first need to discover their identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues about the mysterious figure by taking down the syndicate\u2019s four branch leaders, each situated in a different region of the city, and extract what little information you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They won\u2019t let you catch them easily; you\u2019ll need to best each regions unique roles and mechanics if you hope to get your answers. \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/f07e365de811cd5423256d96ccd58377.avif?t=1773414368\" alt=\"END IT ONCE AND FOR ALL\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all comes to an end once you\u2019ve acquired the clues you need to find the syndicate leader. Use the information you\u2019ve collected to pick the mastermind out of the lineup and end it for good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/extras/05eded008627ea952670f603b0b34a19.avif?t=1773414368\" alt=\"ALTERNATIVE MODES\" width=590 height=106 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is more than just one way to play and experiment within Dupery. Try daily challenges, custom suspect role packs, make custom cases, explore the games workshop support, modding, endless mode, quirk challenges and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan the perfect crime in our Two Player mode<strong>\u00a0</strong>or figure out who is working for the syndicate in our Three player mode.</p>","developers":["Gilded Rune Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845070/92fd5736887b76c80c3596370884c98a56741e0d/header.jpg?t=1773414368","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This game is both created and owned by GILDED RUNE GAMES LIMITED.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></l